{"id":"640035","name":"栗蓉饼","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/640035/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"板栗","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"新鲜板栗洗净煮熟。","img":"images/640035/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"从中间切一刀。","img":"images/640035/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用黄油刀扣出栗肉。","img":"images/640035/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用叉子碾成泥。","img":"images/640035/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"也可以用料理机打一下，那样更加细腻。","img":"images/640035/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅内加玉米油、一点点盐、栗泥。","img":"images/640035/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入白砂糖翻炒均匀。","img":"images/640035/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水继续翻炒。","img":"images/640035/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"小火翻炒。","img":"images/640035/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒成起沙。","img":"images/640035/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"装碗晾凉。","img":"images/640035/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"分成等分。","img":"images/640035/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"用磨具压出喜欢的形状。","img":"images/640035/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"一起吃栗蓉糕吧！","img":"images/640035/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"这个方法做出来的栗蓉可以做烘焙馅料。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}